# The v1 (TypeScript server) dev compose example was removed with the v1
# codebase. Sonarly v2 (Go) is the only server.
#
# Production-shaped deployment: see docker/compose.v2.yaml.example.
# Local development: see docs/development.md — run the Go server with
# `go run ./cmd/sonarly` from v2/ and the web client with `pnpm dev` from
# packages/web/ (vite proxies /api and /rest to localhost:3000).
